<title>USA: CellularVision in pact with NYNEX.</title>
<headline>CellularVision in pact with NYNEX.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>CellularVision USA said Wednesday it had finalized an agreement with NYNEX Corp that clears the way for CellularVision to bundle telephone services with its high-speed Internet access and subscription television services.</p>
<p>In a statement, CellularVision said the agreement allows it to resell, as well as provide, telephone services to customers in the NYNEX operating area.</p>
<p>It said the New York Public Service Commission is expected to approve the agreement shortly.</p>
</text>
